    "text": "Kara Hovick wins female 20-24 division at Heatwave half marathon on Aug. 2, 2026\nBy\nA. R. HunterKara Hovick won the female 20-24 division of the half-marathon at Heatwave Half Marathon - Kansas City in Parkville, Missouri, on Aug. 2, 2026, finishing in 1:59:53 and placing 27th overall, according to the RunSignUp results.\nHovick was listed as being from Leadwood, Missouri.",
